# Platform: mobilesite
# Serial: b2b_assist_9987   (chat cases share one test login — run one at a time)
# Requirement: GJDT-22788 (story GJDT-22788) — Conversational RFQ / B2B Assist, normal category
# Case NC02: Genuine category opens campaign from PDP FAB | P1 | Positive | entry PDP | Mumbai / PVC Pipes | English
# Expected: First bot reply starts campaign (asks length/type)
# Last staging result in the sheet: PASS (05-Oct)
# AI replies: assertions use the regex families from the sheet (Test Data rfq22788_*), not exact text.
# Tags: b2b, rfq, b2b-assist, GJDT-22788, normal, P1
store "Mumbai" as city
store "PVC Pipes" as category
store "(set by the chat step group)" as bot_reply
call SG_22788_Open_PDP_FAB
# opening reply for a genuine page category starts the campaign
verify ${bot_reply} matches "${rfq22788_campaign_started}" ignoring case
take screenshot as nc02_transcript
